  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "國際永續議題發展趨勢與研究",
    "sub_ename": "THE TREND AND STUDIES OF SUSTAINABLE ISSUES IN THE WORLD",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要是想帶引學生了解永續的議題自20世紀以來，如何隨著環境污染與溫室氣體所造成的氣候劇烈變化，以及隨之而來對人類生存環境與生物多樣性所造成的巨大衝擊，而逐漸地成為世界各國所關注的重要議題。並且也希望透過文本閱讀與相關研究案例介紹，使學生認識到永續發展並不僅是環境的議題，事實上它密切的關聯到環境、社會與企業該如何與可如何發展的問題之反思與探討。",
    "describe_eh": "The main goal of this course is to introduce students to the issue of sustainability, which has become increasingly important worldwide since the 20th century due to drastic climate change caused by environmental pollution and greenhouse gas emissions. It aims to raise awareness of the significant impact on human living environments and biodiversity. Through text readings and related research case studies, the course also aims to demonstrate that sustainability is not merely an environmental issue; in fact, it closely relates to reflecting upon and discussing how the environment, society, and businesses can develop and coexist.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "使學生了解永續議題在全世界的緣起與其發展趨勢。",
      "describe_en": "To help students understand the origins and development trends of sustainability issues worldwide."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "使學生可以深入理解相關議題妥適性與相關研究的進展與貢獻。",
      "describe_en": "To enable students to gain a deeper understanding of the relevance and advancements of related issues and research contributions."
    }
  ],
